      "updated": 1784146801294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Ask about model health in natural\nlanguage\n• Scope by crew, owner, model group, model,\nversion\n• Reuse existing metrics APIs\n• Show facts, citations, time range,\nfreshness\n• Detect latency, traffic, error, drift,\nfreshness issues\n• Compare current vs baseline / prior\nversion\n• Recommend investigation steps\n• Create incident / notify owner / trigger\napproved action\n• Support follow-up questions and run\nhistory",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• Ask about model health in natural language\n• Scope by crew, owner, model group, model, version\n• Reuse existing metrics APIs\n• Show facts, citations, time range, freshness\n• Detect latency, traffic, error, drift, freshness issues\n• Compare current vs baseline / prior version\n• Recommend investigation steps\n• Create incident / notify owner / trigger approved action\n• Support follow-up questions and run history",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
