      "updated": 1784146802817,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• 99.9% Q&A availability\n• P95 first token < 1.5s\n• P95 common diagnosis < 15s\n• Metrics remain authoritative\n• Permission-aware retrieval\n• Durable runs and resumability\n• Idempotent actions\n• Full auditability\n• Explicit missing/stale data handling\n• Cost and token limits",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NON-FUNCTIONAL REQUIREMENTS\n\n• 99.9% Q&A availability\n• P95 first token < 1.5s\n• P95 common diagnosis < 15s\n• Metrics remain authoritative\n• Permission-aware retrieval\n• Durable runs and resumability\n• Idempotent actions\n• Full auditability\n• Explicit missing/stale data handling\n• Cost and token limits",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
