      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784146810688,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "EXAMPLE ANSWER FLOW\n\n“Why is recommendations-ranking-v4 unhealthy?”  →  resolve model/version  →  fetch latency, traffic, errors, features, freshness, deployment, lineage  →  deterministic detection  →  LLM correlates facts  →\ncited explanation + confidence + next steps  →  optional approved incident / notification / remediation\n\nStaff signal: the AI is a trustworthy diagnosis and workflow layer on top of Model Foundry—not a replacement for the metrics platform.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "EXAMPLE ANSWER FLOW\n\n“Why is recommendations-ranking-v4 unhealthy?”  →  resolve model/version  →  fetch latency, traffic, errors, features, freshness, deployment, lineage  →  deterministic detection  →  LLM correlates facts  →  cited explanation + confidence + next steps  →  optional approved incident / notification / remediation\n\nStaff signal: the AI is a trustworthy diagnosis and workflow layer on top of Model Foundry—not a replacement for the metrics platform.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
